# The layer-feature cache written by extract_layers.py is a LARGE regenerable
# intermediate, not a lesson artifact: H is fp16 [n_prompts, n_layers, n_poolings,
# hidden], i.e. ~180 MB at 1000 prompts x 26 layers x 3 poolings x 1152 dims.
# Unlike the small lesson binaries (probe.pt, features.npz) it is NOT force-added.
# It is fully reproducible from the config stamped in its own header (`meta`), and
# every number derived from it carries that fingerprint in sweep_layers_*.json.
layer_features_*.npz
